{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19107380","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19107380","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1910738001:1":{"text":"我听说，你找到了避免神堕的方法？","source_cn":"我听说，你找到了避免神堕的方法？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xE70619DB3C459FA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910738002:1":{"text":"是啊，坐在礁石上看鱼群迁徙时，我突然灵机一动。","source_cn":"是啊，坐在礁石上看鱼群迁徙时，我突然灵机一动。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x65C89F8BEB398F07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910738003:1":{"text":"那恐怕是只有我才能用的方法。你想知道吗？","source_cn":"那恐怕是只有我才能用的方法。你想知道吗？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xF01D2ACE699E0E06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910738004:1":{"text":"请告诉我。","source_cn":"请告诉我。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xA41901F84BBC8168","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910738005:1":{"text":"你知道我的权能，我可以将自己分化成无数碎片，每一片都会流入这汪大海，成为独立的生命。","source_cn":"你知道我的权能，我可以将自己分化成无数碎片，每一片都会...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x67571209BD25D5A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910738006:1":{"text":"我不再是“我”，我连自己都遗忘，彻底成为另一种存在——无数类似凡人的存在，到那时，令诸神堕落的罪恶之源也对此会障目。","source_cn":"我不再是“我”，我连自己都遗忘，彻底成为另一种存在——...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xE4100F5FDA1FBEA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910738007:1":{"text":"等到沧海桑田，几百年后，我会在眷属的帮助下，以神明的姿态再度醒来。然后在被找到之前，再次散入大海，循环往复数千万年。","source_cn":"等到沧海桑田，几百年后，我会在眷属的帮助下，以神明的姿...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x79650B81504C9C56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910738008:1":{"text":"这就是你想到的方法？","source_cn":"这就是你想到的方法？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x5225F931674DB747","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910738009:1":{"text":"是的，我会完全改变自己，那将是我未来存在的方式。","source_cn":"是的，我会完全改变自己，那将是我未来存在的方式。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x16EBA9C1F16CF825","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910738010:1":{"text":"避免神堕，就没有兵戈相见的理由。虽然此后相隔数百年才能再次与你相见，但我可以把它当做是一场短暂的梦，我会睡得非常安稳……","source_cn":"避免神堕，就没有兵戈相见的理由。虽然此后相隔数百年才能...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x31A36892107A2DAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910738011:1":{"text":"我只希望你的双手不再次被亲人的鲜血染红，亲爱的妹妹。","source_cn":"我只希望你的双手不再次被亲人的鲜血染红，亲爱的妹妹。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xA695E486C83091DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910738012:1":{"text":"但那些碎片，他们已经不再是你，他们会拥有自己的意识、情感、家人。他们会爱，会痛，会恐惧自身的消逝！","source_cn":"但那些碎片，他们已经不再是你，他们会拥有自己的意识、情...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xD04AA0720304FC9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910738013:1":{"text":"你让他们以为自己是独立的生命，却最终要被你的意识取代。","source_cn":"你让他们以为自己是独立的生命，却最终要被你的意识取代。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x5AD4CCBA8D7F1D8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910738014:1":{"text":"那对凡人而言是死亡，奥汐娜。在凡人的视野里，你杀了他们……那将是数个族裔的灭绝！","source_cn":"那对凡人而言是死亡，奥汐娜。在凡人的视野里，你杀了他们...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x710AC75D29E00A8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910738015:1":{"text":"我的碎片将有超越常人的寿命，彼此间刻入骨髓的链接，以及不畏惧任何凡人的力量。","source_cn":"我的碎片将有超越常人的寿命，彼此间刻入骨髓的链接，以及...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x2BFF4BB2D14704E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910738016:1":{"text":"他们将幸福，友爱，不谙世事……直至最后如河流奔向海洋，雨滴落入潮水。","source_cn":"他们将幸福，友爱，不谙世事……直至最后如河流奔向海洋，...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x67508CB19B5E8DA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1910738017:1":{"text":"亲爱的妹妹，你能明白吗？在我之前，他们不存在；在我之后，他们也不存在。","source_cn":"亲爱的妹妹，你能明白吗？在我之前，他们不存在；在我之后...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xB2664567957449E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1910738018:1":{"text":"我没有创造他们，我就是他们；我也不会取代他们，他们会成为我，他们就是我。","source_cn":"我没有创造他们，我就是他们；我也不会取代他们，他们会成...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xBD43CA0640F7CC6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1910738019:1":{"text":"对有独立意识的个体而言，这仍然和消亡毫无区别。","source_cn":"对有独立意识的个体而言，这仍然和消亡毫无区别。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x60DD08D322C2B32B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1910738020:1":{"text":"那么，你要屠杀成千上万还未来得及诞生的生命，以及……我吗？","source_cn":"那么，你要屠杀成千上万还未来得及诞生的生命，以及……我吗？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x30D4175CE72C6BFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_tit