会全然应允，但只论当下，我可以...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x67278C913E6B5E6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1910738032:1":{"text":"你会答应的，妹妹，因为我了解你！","source_cn":"你会答应的，妹妹，因为我了解你！","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x33BD2E44F7ACC827","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1910738033:1":{"text":"在我重新聚合复苏的时候，爆发的神力会使深海沸腾，浅海死寂，洪水将席卷陆上的生灵——那些你在意的凡人。","source_cn":"在我重新聚合复苏的时候，爆发的神力会使深海沸腾，浅海死...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x71CE0E9718437F23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1910738034:1":{"text":"我的愿望是：当复苏发生时，你能代替我，去为陆地沿岸提供庇护。","source_cn":"我的愿望是：当复苏发生时，你能代替我，去为陆地沿岸提供庇护。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xDE462F55F9BF129B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1910738035:1":{"text":"……我无法理解你，奥汐娜，你想创造并抹杀一个种族，但与此同时，却想保护海边的凡人？","source_cn":"……我无法理解你，奥汐娜，你想创造并抹杀一个种族，但与...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x87DCE71878BF0F14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1910738036:1":{"text":"你在意凡人，所以我会在意凡人。当然，我更会爱我自己。","source_cn":"你在意凡人，所以我会在意凡